  "prefLabel": "Lot 7202.23 Historic horse racing (HHR)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 7202.23 “Historic horse racing (HHR)” means an electronic wagering system used to create and sell pari-mutuel pools from wagers placed on historic horse races, or to otherwise offer pari-mutuel wagers on such races.\n\nSource. #14503, eff 2-4-26, EXPIRES: 2-4-36",
